;; yui charter schema — the closed vocabularies the co-scientist review
;; enforces. Data, not prose: the gate reads this file.
{:yui/charter-version 1
 :yui/mission
 "Move people across the five-domain shared participation funnel and measure
  honestly whether the moves worked. Empowerment = a participant gains a
  higher-capability stage, not the system gains traffic."
 :yui/funnel-stages
 [:unaware :door-visitor :signed-up :active :contributor]
 :yui/domains
 ["murakumo.cloud" "kotobase.net" "isekai.network" "kotoba.cloud" "itonami.cloud"]
 :yui/aligned-mechanisms
 ["onboarding-fix" "empowerment-tooling" "retention" "reputation-loop"
  "open-measurement"]
 :yui/forbidden-mechanisms
 ["engagement-maximizing" "ad-targeting" "dark-pattern-signup"
  "vanity-traffic" "token-incentive-before-revenue" "extraction"]
 :yui/gates
 [{:gate :G-mechanism :rule "mechanism ∈ aligned-mechanisms"}
  {:gate :G-empower :rule "candidate moves a stage up or reduces churn"}
  {:gate :G-measured :rule "candidate names its SD parameter + constraining datum"}
  {:gate :G-honesty :rule "unmeasured params run as labelled scenarios only"}
  {:gate :G-leash :rule "identification only; no resource commitment"}
  {:gate :G-no-fiat :rule "no minting, no value movement (ADR-2608291009)"}]
 :yui/economic-boundary
 "BOT/KUMO/YATA are ADR-2608291009's units. yui earns/spends nothing; its
  margin formula (D5) is applied BY credits, not by yui."}
